in new orders."]}]	{"weeklyFocus": {"week1": "Mastering Visit Discipline: Focus on consistent photo check-ins/checkouts and improving on-time visit rates. Aim for 80% photo usage and 70% on-time visits this week.", "week2": "Boosting Productivity and Territory Coverage: Increase the daily visit rate and aim for 5 active days this week. Focus on structured planning to optimize territory travel.", "week3": "Driving Product Mix & Retailer Development: Introduce a minimum of two different product categories in every order. Identify and attempt to activate two new retailers.", "week4": "Consolidating Performance & Revenue Growth: Review all core competencies. Focus on improving revenue per visit and capturing more orders, ensuring collection efficiency is maintained."}, "motivationalNote": "This is just the starting line, and every great athlete begins with foundational steps. Your commitment to collections and initial revenue generation shows your potential. Embrace the learning curve, stay persistent, and remember that consistent, disciplined effort will transform these early numbers into significant success!"}	\N	f	\N	2026-01-13 06:26:30.996326+00	2026-01-13 10:04:49.501617+00	24f9138a-6390-44e6-901d-701d0d75702e
